{"3582430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Uh Oh Airlines", "steam_appid": 3582430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/72f3e19f9d64da35036307f53ed56eab.poster.avif?t=1787800075\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/72f3e19f9d64da35036307f53ed56eab.webm?t=1787800075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome aboard <strong>Uh Oh Airlines</strong>: the delightfully unhinged single player or co-op flight attendant simulator where the skies are friendly, the passengers are feral, and disaster is always cruising at 30,000 feet. Play solo or team up with a friend as you juggle spilled sodas, mysterious smells, and passenger meltdowns, while trying to keep everyone (including yourself) from spiraling into full airborne anarchy.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/7b61287f1047b504b7ab6a9a35b3c7b8.avif?t=1787800075\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras_big/7b61287f1047b504b7ab6a9a35b3c7b8.avif?t=1787800075 width=800 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/afb772929d6f96917f39325e2e76a2b1.poster.avif?t=1787800075\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/afb772929d6f96917f39325e2e76a2b1.webm?t=1787800075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve drinks and soothe panicked flyers while pretending you aren’t <i>also</i> mildly panicked. Wrestle open overhead bins that seem to defy the laws of physics, dodge projectile dogs and cats, and clean up mystery liquids. Was it soda? Something worse? Don't ask us! Try not to think too hard about that while still thinking on your feet, because in this full-throttle frenzy, every second counts, and the seatbelt sign is basically just a suggestion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/05d992bf94afb809f833b4a5662062ff.avif?t=1787800075\" width=800 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/08b670b0bea48cfe66df3544cc9749ad.poster.avif?t=1787800075\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/08b670b0bea48cfe66df3544cc9749ad.webm?t=1787800075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catastrophes are coming in hot, sometimes literally. You could rise to the occasion and douse the flames (both metaphorical and real)… or just let it all burn in glorious chaos. But, uh, maybe grab the fire extinguisher. Just a thought.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re flying solo or teaming up with a friend, one thing’s for sure: things are about to get bumpy. Tray tables up and buckle up. This is your captain speaking: <i><strong>good luck.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have any questions? Check out our FAQ's</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Disclaimer!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Thank you for supporting this project. Uh Oh Airlines is currently incomplete and in the alpha phase of development. Please help me get the game to beta by submitting bug reports either via the in-game feedback form or by joining the Discord server. <strong>Keep in mind that the game may contain bugs at this stage, so we recommend joining if you’re excited to be part of the journey and don’t mind a little turbulence along the way.</strong></i> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/72f3e19f9d64da35036307f53ed56eab.poster.avif?t=1787800075\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/72f3e19f9d64da35036307f53ed56eab.webm?t=1787800075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome aboard <strong>Uh Oh Airlines</strong>: the delightfully unhinged single player or co-op flight attendant simulator where the skies are friendly, the passengers are feral, and disaster is always cruising at 30,000 feet. Play solo or team up with a friend as you juggle spilled sodas, mysterious smells, and passenger meltdowns, while trying to keep everyone (including yourself) from spiraling into full airborne anarchy.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/7b61287f1047b504b7ab6a9a35b3c7b8.avif?t=1787800075\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras_big/7b61287f1047b504b7ab6a9a35b3c7b8.avif?t=1787800075 width=800 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/afb772929d6f96917f39325e2e76a2b1.poster.avif?t=1787800075\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/afb772929d6f96917f39325e2e76a2b1.webm?t=1787800075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve drinks and soothe panicked flyers while pretending you aren’t <i>also</i> mildly panicked. Wrestle open overhead bins that seem to defy the laws of physics, dodge projectile dogs and cats, and clean up mystery liquids. Was it soda? Something worse? Don't ask us! Try not to think too hard about that while still thinking on your feet, because in this full-throttle frenzy, every second counts, and the seatbelt sign is basically just a suggestion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/05d992bf94afb809f833b4a5662062ff.avif?t=1787800075\" width=800 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/08b670b0bea48cfe66df3544cc9749ad.poster.avif?t=1787800075\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/08b670b0bea48cfe66df3544cc9749ad.webm?t=1787800075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catastrophes are coming in hot, sometimes literally. You could rise to the occasion and douse the flames (both metaphorical and real)… or just let it all burn in glorious chaos. But, uh, maybe grab the fire extinguisher. Just a thought.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re flying solo or teaming up with a friend, one thing’s for sure: things are about to get bumpy. Tray tables up and buckle up. This is your captain speaking: <i><strong>good luck.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have any questions? Check out our FAQ's</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Disclaimer!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Thank you for supporting this project. Uh Oh Airlines is currently incomplete and in the alpha phase of development. Please help me get the game to beta by submitting bug reports either via the in-game feedback form or by joining the Discord server. <strong>Keep in mind that the game may contain bugs at this stage, so we recommend joining if you’re excited to be part of the journey and don’t mind a little turbulence along the way.</strong></i> </p>", "short_description": "Serve drinks, wrangle passengers, and survive turbulence in this silly solo or co-op flight attendant simulator. Handle routine cabin duties while everything goes hilariously wrong, from loose pets to spiraling passenger panic. It’s pure cabin chaos at 30,000 feet!", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Dutch, Indonesian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Latvian, Malay, Italian, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/d43cacecff76df968678e9388b0f4725d8e4733e/header.jpg?t=1787800075", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/67b3de23b5c69201db4ce9a1a013cc2eab5bdde1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787800075", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/67b3de23b5c69201db4ce9a1a013cc2eab5bdde1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787800075", "website": "https://uhoh-airlines.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 15<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> M4<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Steamdeck OS - Proton Experimental Required<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["Bomas Game Studio"], "publishers": ["Bomas Game Studio"], "demos": [{"appid": 3582760, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1799, "final": 1799, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$17.99"}, "packages": [1263775], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Uh Oh Airlines", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1263775, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Uh Oh Airlines - $17.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 1799}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": true, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 39, "description": "Shared/Split Screen Co-op"}, {"id": 24, "description": "Shared/Split Screen"}, {"id": 22, "des